Copyright (c) 2026 SkillQA Pro. All rights reserved.

1. GRANT OF LICENSE
   SkillQA Pro is distributed as proprietary software in two editions:

   - DEMO (free): static scan module and the demo teaser report.
     May be used without a license key for evaluation purposes.

   - PRO (paid): all seven verification modules (static, sandbox, log,
     novelty, load, parallel, compat), the full certification report
     (Markdown certificate with grade A/B/C/D) and machine-readable JSON
     reports for CI. Requires a valid license key bound to the machine-id
     of the computer where it is installed.

2. LICENSE KEY
   A Pro license key is a signed file (skillqa_license.dat) that is bound
   to one machine-id (sha256 of /etc/machine-id, /var/lib/dbus/machine-id
   or hostname, first 16 hex characters). The key must not be shared,
   redistributed or installed on machines other than the one it was
   issued for.

